<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1905</h1><p class="ref-lede">1905 in world history: 50 events, 15 births, 21 deaths, 5 works, 2 states founded and 2 that came to an end. 796 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
